{"id":"d1bdc5d626d71488","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-t-normalization.md","title":"System T的正规化与合流接口","display":"thm-system-t-normalization — System T的正规化与合流接口","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-t-normalization","aliases":["72-thm-system-t-normalization"],"display":"thm-system-t-normalization — System T的正规化与合流接口","depends_on":["[[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]","[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]]","[[72-df-confluence]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V Lemma4.3.1 and Theorem4.3.3, print359–360/PDF371–372; source statement and proof outline read","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-t-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-t-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-t-normalization — System T的正规化与合流接口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a273d157ddbe764d\" href=\"?note=a273d157ddbe764d\" title=\"72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction\">72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97a98663b21af886\" href=\"?note=97a98663b21af886\" title=\"72-df-system-t-normal-form\">72-df-system-t-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f91888dacef2bdf\" href=\"?note=9f91888dacef2bdf\" title=\"72-df-confluence\">72-df-confluence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V Lemma4.3.1 and Theorem4.3.3, print359–360/PDF371–372; source statement and proof outline read"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\sigma:=\\rho_T\\cap\\mathcal T_\\sigma^2\">\\(R_\\sigma:=\\rho_T\\cap\\mathcal T_\\sigma^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TNF}\">\\(\\operatorname{TNF}\\)</span> 取相同关系载体与 α 商。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(\\mathcal T_\\sigma,R_\\sigma),\\qquad\n\\forall s\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ \\exists!t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ \\operatorname{TNF}_\\sigma(s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Conf}(\\mathcal T_\\sigma,R_\\sigma),\\qquad\n\\forall s\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ \\exists!t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\ \\operatorname{TNF}_\\sigma(s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源为 Lemma4.3.1 的合流与 Theorem4.3.3 的正规化，适用 λ 项呈现由前页明确允许。读到该节可归约性证明：基型按可正规化定义，箭头型要求作用于可归约参数后仍可归约；对适型推导归纳。唯一性另由合流与正规形无后继推出。这里记录来源所支持的弱正规化接口，没有把完整可归约性证明冒称已在笔记或证明助手中重建，也未额外断言任意未类型化项正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":